%% Sequence diagram: Docket documentation and paid-launch gates
sequenceDiagram
    actor Maintainer
    participant CI as Release CI
    participant Product as Production Docket
    participant Docs as Mintlify docs
    participant Stripe as Hypertext Studio Stripe

    Maintainer->>CI: Submit one release candidate
    CI-->>Maintainer: Return product and docs checks
    Maintainer->>Product: Deploy with Checkout closed
    Product-->>Maintainer: Return production verification evidence
    Maintainer->>Docs: Publish the verified guide
    Docs-->>Maintainer: Return live-site verification evidence
    Maintainer->>Stripe: Run the approved paid canary
    Stripe-->>Maintainer: Return billing and reconciliation evidence
    Maintainer->>Maintainer: Observe the canary for 72 hours
    Maintainer->>Product: Open public Checkout
